{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16103120","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16103120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610312001:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">피파</style>, 물에는 어쩌다 빠진 거야?","source_cn":"<style=highlight>皮帕</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67115CDB6F777214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610312002:0":{"text":"에... 에취! 실수로 떨어졌지 뭐야... 사실 헤엄쳐서 나올 수 있었는데 그 <style=\"highlight\">짜증나는 물고기</style>들이 옷을 물고 당겨서 꼼짝도 못 했어!","source_cn":"我……阿嚏！我不小心掉下去了……其实我能游上来的，可那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF52FF3A4207AD356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610312003:1":{"text":"그 물고기들, 만져 보니까 돌처럼 딱딱하더라. 생김새도 그렇고. 이 호수에서 그런 건 처음 봐.","source_cn":"那些鱼摸起来硬梆梆的，长得也硬梆梆的，我以前都没在湖里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41B03004E269DC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610312004:1":{"text":"어, 이건... 종소리?","source_cn":"欸，这是……敲钟的声音吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE24D59DE5FD42B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610312005:1":{"text":"나머지는 나중에 이야기하자. 집합 종이 울렸어. 얼른 섬으로 가지 않으면 개막식을 놓치게 될 거야.","source_cn":"嗯，这些回头再说吧，集合的钟声已经响了，我们得快些上岛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3350A3AF3D2CE10C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610312006:1":{"text":"아, 알겠어. 도와줘서 고마워...","source_cn":"啊好的，总之，谢谢你们救了我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64E38A7E5DED3FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:休":{"text":"실벤","source":"休","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"피파","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}